+## v1.4.4 — automatic Groww readiness
+
+- Automatically checks the saved Groww-whitelisted public IP and refreshes the TOTP-based access token at about 08:45 IST every day.
+- Performs the same read-only NSE CASH user-profile verification used by the manual refresh button.
+- Reschedules after reboot, app update, clock/time-zone changes, and also self-checks when the app or notification listener starts.
+- Temporary failures retry every 5 minutes up to six times; a static-IP mismatch blocks authentication instead of trading from the wrong egress IP.
+- The manual Refresh & Test button remains available as a fallback.
+- Startup no longer silently disarms previously saved Multyfi/Univest toggles merely because the new token window has begun before auto-auth finishes.
+- Univest averaging remains ₹5,000 at −2% / −4% / −6%; the stale −3% / −6% / −9% text in the execution-contract card is corrected.
+- Groww may still reject token generation if the account/API credential itself requires user approval; this build automates the TOTP-token flow already configured in the app and does not bypass Groww account controls.
